<title>USA: Metropolitan Bancorp shareholders OK merger.</title>
<headline>Metropolitan Bancorp shareholders OK merger.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Bancorp said its shareholders approved the merger with Washington Federal Savings &amp; Loan Association.</p>
<p>It said the merger, which already was approved by regulators, should be completed in late November or early December.</p>
<p>Each shareholder of Metropolitan will receive shares of Washington Federal common stock at an expected value of $18 in exchange for each share of Metropolitan.</p>
</text>
